{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes 6 levels across 5 different worlds so that you can enjoy the fast paced, beautifully pixeled, and head-boppingly musicalized action of Go Slimey Go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Go Slimey Go!</i> is an easy-to-pick-up game for all players! Easy to learn and hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by family-friendly platformers like Yoshi's Island and Kirby, it combines charm with challenge, with intuitive controls and progressively tougher levels that surprise players and test their skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799960/extras/HouseGIF.gif?t=1749770502\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce your way through many meticulously hand crafted levels across five different worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't fight, avoid all conflict to reach your goal! Enemies are (mostly!) harmless, but little slippery you are harmless as well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your squishiness is your strongest weapon! Bounce onto, into and across enemies to reach new heights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive  boss battles where you are not the target! Try not to get caught in the ultimate showdown between good and evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799960/extras/HarmlessEnemies3.gif?t=1749770502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Just go, Slimey, go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799960/extras/Goblet.gif?t=1749770502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799960?t=