vive  boss battles where you are not the target! Try not to get caught in the ultimate showdown between good and evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799960/extras/HarmlessEnemies3.gif?t=1749770502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Just go, Slimey, go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799960/extras/Goblet.gif?t=1749770502\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Tembac","Chabbie","joacoyco"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3215230","name":"Go Slimey Go!"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799960/a52b4ef13ba8a23c1e1c7ef56cd53f9c7cb5962c/header.jpg?t=1749770502","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\"Go Slimey Go!\" is a copyrighted trademark","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151435,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151435/movie480.mp4?t=1749475740","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151435/movie_max.mp4?t=1749475740"},"name":"Go Slimey Go! Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151435/e4caf403db3c10996eb62199736df3c061b81c92/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749475740","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151435/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749475740","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c